    {
      "version": "1.12",
      "date": "2026-11-20",
      "title": "MsnUpdator arrives",
      "description": "First version managed by MsnUpdator. From now on, updates arrive automatically while the game launcher is open.\n\n- CnCNet updates are switched off, so nothing outside our group changes the game.\n- LAN screen: MsnUpdator button on the left, with the installed version shown big next to it. The button opens the update log, with Update and Roll back.\n- Main menu: the bottom bar now says 'No updates from MSN.'\n- While an update installs, a small note appears in the bottom-right corner, then a Restart button if the launcher must restart.\n- If an update ever fails, a short message explains why (except for internet problems, which are retried quietly).\n- Includes everything from v1.11: Muhannad Soldier and all custom rules, Mega Nuke with the 2x mushroom cloud, CnCNet 9.4.1 network files.",
